    <template id="vat_gst_consumption_tax_page" name="VAT, GST, and Consumption Tax">
        <t t-call="website.layout">
            <div id="wrap" class="mouser-homepage mouser-help-page gst-bill-page vat-tax-page">
                <t t-call="mouser_theme.mouser_common_header"/>
                <main class="mouser-shell vat-tax-content-wrap">
                    <div class="gst-breadcrumb"><a href="/mouser-home">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/help/credit-sales-and-tax">Credit, Payment Methods, and Tax</a><span>›</span><strong>VAT, GST, and Consumption Tax</strong></div>
                    <h1>VAT, GST, and Consumption Tax</h1>
                    <p class="vat-tax-subtitle">Value Added Tax (VAT), Goods and Services Tax (GST), and Consumption Tax</p>

                    <section class="vat-tax-main">
                        <p>Customers are responsible for paying all applicable VAT/GST/Consumption Tax charges.</p>
                        <p>Depending on the shipping destination of your order, you will be able to provide a VAT, GST or other government-issued identification number during the checkout process. These numbers will be stored in your Mouser account.</p>
                        <p><strong>Due to Brexit changes in the United Kingdom, Mouser will begin charging the UK VAT rate of 20% on shipments to the UK starting 22 December 2020.</strong> However, if there are line items associated with the qualifying commodity code (8542319000) and if the merchandise total of those line items exceeds £5,000 GBP then those items will qualify for reverse charge according to section 3.4 of VAT Notice 735 Is. We will notify users in the cart if line items meet the criteria and VAT is not charged.</p>
                        <p>For information about our UK Tax Strategy, please <a href="/pdfdocs/UK-Tax-Strategy.pdf" target="_blank">download this PDF</a>.</p>
                    </section>

                    <p class="back-link vat-tax-back"><a href="/help/credit-sales-and-tax">‹Back to Credit, Payment Methods, and Tax</a></p>

                    <section class="related-articles vat-tax-related">
                        <h2>Related Articles</h2>
                        <a href="/help/credit-sales-and-tax/sales-tax">U.S. Sales Tax</a><br/>
                        <a href="/help/credit-sales-and-tax/methods-of-payment">Methods of Payment</a>
                    </section>

